sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Controller
    participant Service
    participant JWT
    participant Repository
    participant MongoDB
    participant Redis

    Client->>Controller: POST /auth/login
    Controller->>Service: login(email, password)
    Service->>Repository: findByEmail(email)
    Repository->>MongoDB: query users
    MongoDB-->>Repository: user document
    Repository-->>Service: user
    Service->>Service: bcrypt.compare(password)
    Service->>JWT: generateTokens(user)
    JWT->>Redis: store session
    Redis-->>JWT: session stored
    JWT-->>Service: {access, refresh}
    Service-->>Controller: AuthResponse
    Controller-->>Client: 200 OK {tokens, user}
